Third-party source code included in this repository: none.

The Java plugin bridge (bridge/java) is an independent implementation of the
Bukkit/Spigot/Paper APIs. No code from CraftBukkit, Spigot or Paper server
sources is included; if any is ported in the future it will be listed here
with its project, URL and license, and keep its original license header.

Libraries downloaded at runtime (not bundled; pinned in internal/bridge/libs.go):
  paper-api            https://repo.papermc.io  GPL-3.0 / MIT (Bukkit API: GPL-3.0)
  brigadier            https://repo.papermc.io  MIT (Mojang)
  adventure            https://repo1.maven.org  MIT (KyoriPowered)
  and the other artifacts listed in internal/bridge/libs.go under their own licenses.
